    "detailed_description": "The Ancien Cat Temple is a small Metroidvania (40min - 1hour  approximately) where you are an archeologist cat who will explore the cave that holds the wonders of an ancient civilization. On your back is a lantern that will help you to light your way through this dark cave.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, the flashlight is not always your best option, cave mushrooms are fluorescent but will only light up when you touch them and there is no other source of light on.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore the cave find puzzles and the tools needed to unravel these puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be careful! Lights on at unnecessary times can end up attracting dangerous creatures!",
